WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
Juri guards the recorded Ryu OD Shoryuken.

2
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:02.700
Raw Drive Rush reaches forward heavy during Ryu’s recovery.

3
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:03.200
Forward heavy scores the Punish Counter.

4
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:03.700
Crouching heavy punch links from the Rush punish.

5
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:04.700
Heavy Fuhajin launches Ryu.

6
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:07.350
Heavy Tensenrin completes the punish.
